Supplementary Material for Smoothness Errors in Dynamics Models and How to Avoid Them

Contains: 

1. LieUni_timelapse_loop.gif , which shows the evolving Rayleigh quotient distributions for Lie unitary convolution for different T_max
2. heat_armadillo_comparison_landscape.gif , which shows the evolving heat distribution over the armadillos at each time step. From left to right, Truth, R-UniMesh (ours), EMAN, Hermes.
